abstract: "Agent Cognitive Continuity Framework is an external model-supporting framework for LLM agent workflows. It helps the host model preserve source-linked memory, execution state, task-wide constraints, and functional attention continuity across long work while the model retains planning, tool-use, semantic-judgment, recovery, and final-answer ownership."
